{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "kind": "feature",
  "title": "分组选中样式三方案决策",
  "profile": "frontend",
  "runtime": "native",
  "delivery": "portable",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "src-screenshot",
      "label": "用户截图：浅色界面 Tab 下列表无明显选中态"
    },
    {
      "id": "src-main",
      "label": "packages/core/src/main.ts 选中态强制 transparent/none"
    },
    {
      "id": "src-css",
      "label": "packages/core/styles/app.css 仅 hover 有背景，选中只显示 PID"
    },
    {
      "id": "src-tokens",
      "label": "packages/core/styles/tokens.css 已有 --bg-row-sel / --bg-row-hover"
    },
    {
      "id": "src-dense-test",
      "label": "packages/core/src/dense-list-style.test.ts 当前断言禁止选中背景与左线"
    },
    {
      "id": "src-user-goal",
      "label": "用户目标：极简、可见、常用键盘流；分组选中要重构为 3 套方案"
    }
  ],
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim-current-invisible",
      "text": "当前选中态几乎不可见，不是颜色太浅，而是主行选中背景与左边线被刻意关闭。",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "sourceIds": [
        "src-screenshot",
        "src-main",
        "src-css",
        "src-dense-test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-token-ready",
      "text": "设计 token 里已有 --bg-row-sel 与 --bg-row-hover，可直接复用，不必引入彩色强调。",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "sourceIds": [
        "src-tokens",
        "src-css"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-group-scope",
      "text": "选中应以进程组为单位：主行与已展开 helper 共用同一当前组样式。",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "sourceIds": [
        "src-user-goal",
        "src-main"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-recommend-a",
      "text": "方案 A（轻底 + 左线）最适合当前目标：一眼可见、黑白极简、不破坏高密度。",
      "status": "inferred",
      "sourceIds": [
        "src-user-goal",
        "src-tokens",
        "src-screenshot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-test-update",
      "text": "落地任一套可见选中方案时，必须同步改 dense-list-style 测试，当前测试明确禁止背景和左线。",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "sourceIds": [
        "src-dense-test",
        "src-main"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "block-problem",
      "type": "text",
      "title": "问题判断",
      "claimIds": [
        "claim-current-invisible",
        "claim-token-ready"
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "你现在看到的不是“选中背景和面板背景差不多”，而是选中样式被关掉了。",
        "updateRow 会把主行 background 强制写成 transparent，并把 boxShadow 写成 none。CSS 只给 hover 行铺底，选中行只靠显示 PID 提示位置。",
        "浅色面板底是 #fafafa，行默认也是透明，所以截图里 Dia / ChatGPT / 企业微信几乎看不出当前行。",
        "好消息是 token 已经准备好了：浅色 --bg-row-sel=#e8e8e8、--bg-row-hover=#f1f1f1；深色 --bg-row-sel=#202020、--bg-row-hover=#151515。重构时优先复用黑白体系，不引入彩色。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "block-compare",
      "type": "table",
      "title": "三方案对比",
      "claimIds": [
        "claim-group-scope",
        "claim-recommend-a"
      ],
      "columns": [
        {
          "key": "scheme",
          "label": "方案"
        },
        {
          "key": "look",
          "label": "视觉"
        },
        {
          "key": "strength",
          "label": "优势"
        },
        {
          "key": "risk",
          "label": "风险"
        },
        {
          "key": "fit",
          "label": "适合场景"
        }
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "scheme": "A. 轻底 + 左线（推荐）",
          "look": "当前组浅灰底 + 2px 左线；hover 弱于 selected；展开 helper 与主行同底",
          "strength": "位置一眼可见；符合任务管理器/Finder 习惯；黑白极简",
          "risk": "比纯文字稍重一点",
          "fit": "常用用户、键盘快速定位、默认落地"
        },
        {
          "scheme": "B. 仅左线 + 名称加粗",
          "look": "无整行底；2px 左线；名称 450→600；PID 常显",
          "strength": "最干净；对一屏密度影响最小",
          "risk": "快速扫列表时仍可能不够醒目",
          "fit": "极度克制、讨厌色块"
        },
        {
          "scheme": "C. 整组卡片块",
          "look": "当前组圆角卡片 + 细边框；helper 包进同一卡片",
          "strength": "分组结构最清楚；结束前最不容易点错组",
          "risk": "视觉最重；长列表会有块状感",
          "fit": "强调按应用分组结束"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "block-tokens",
      "type": "table",
      "title": "建议 token / 样式规则",
      "claimIds": [
        "claim-token-ready",
        "claim-group-scope"
      ],
      "columns": [
        {
          "key": "state",
          "label": "状态"
        },
        {
          "key": "light",
          "label": "浅色"
        },
        {
          "key": "dark",
          "label": "深色"
        },
        {
          "key": "note",
          "label": "规则"
        }
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "state": "默认行",
          "light": "透明",
          "dark": "透明",
          "note": "保持高密度表格感"
        },
        {
          "state": "hover",
          "light": "#f1f1f1",
          "dark": "#151515",
          "note": "只作用于未选中行；弱于 selected"
        },
        {
          "state": "selected 组",
          "light": "底 #e8e8e8 + 左线 #171717",
          "dark": "底 #202020 + 左线 #f5f5f5",
          "note": "主行与展开 helper 共用；方案 A 默认"
        },
        {
          "state": "selected 文本",
          "light": "名称可保持 450 或轻提到 500",
          "dark": "同左",
          "note": "方案 B 才强制 600，避免 A/C 过重"
        },
        {
          "state": "PID 提示",
          "light": "selected / hover / focus-within 显示",
          "dark": "同左",
          "note": "保留现有轻量定位，不单独承担选中识别"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "block-flow",
